# Runtime state, created on demand: this machine's reports and the map
# changes approved from them. The surveyed graph in data/campus_graph.json
# stays the committed source of truth.
data/reports.json
data/graph_overrides.json
data/photos/

# Not ignored for now, unlike the rest of the runtime state above: committing
# the plan store is what lets a fresh clone draw the map without anyone
# running scripts/install_floorplans.py first. The cost is that a floorplan
# uploaded through admin mode now shows up as a local change.

# Handover notes, shared by hand rather than committed.
HANDOVER.md

SESSION_MEMORY.md
